			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 737130101,
					"content": "鏘鏘！就是這裡了，從一片淺灘下水，應該會有畫卷慢慢展開的感覺！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						737130102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 737130102,
					"content": "#咦，是{F#妳}{M#你}們…還帶了新夥伴？這個是…蕈獸嗎？以前只在書上看過…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						737130103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪因"
				},
				{
					"id": 737130103,
					"content": "真巧，還有美露莘在這裡玩！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						737130104,
						737130105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 737130104,
					"content": "又見面啦，瑪因。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						737130106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 737130106,
					"content": "不是玩哦，是在採汐藻。準備製作今年份的醃製汐藻，許多姐姐妹妹都回到村裡幫忙了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						737130107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪因"
				},
				{
					"id": 737130107,
					"content": "昂吉安妮大姐頭和小蘿克珊都請假回來了，現在正在忙呢，待會我也要下水了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						737130108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪因"
				},
				{
					"id": 737130108,
					"content": "對了，昂吉安妮大姐頭沒說錯，藍色的蕈獸還真的有點像汐藻…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						737130109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪因"
				},
				{
					"id": 737130109,
					"content": "我的意思是，很討人喜歡，沒有想吃的意思…嗯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						737130110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪因"
				},
				{
					"id": 737130110,
					"content": "♫♪~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						737130111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "咚咚小圓帽"
				},
				{
					"id": 737130111,
					"content": "嘿嘿，妳很有眼光嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						737130112,
						737130113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 737130112,
					"content": "蕈獸夥伴真的可愛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						737130114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 737130114,
					"content": "#總而言之，很高興遇見{F#妳}{M#你}們，我要去工作了，也祝{F#妳}{M#你}們在附近玩得開心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						737130115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瑪因"
				},
				{
					"id": 737130115,
					"content": "那我們也出發吧？和蕈獸夥伴們好好拍一拍楓丹水下的漂亮景觀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 737130113,
					"content": "美露莘們也都不賴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						737130114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 737130105,
					"content": "妳好啊，沒見過的美露莘。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
